# wrangler files
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example

# tooling
node_modules
.DS_Store
*.log

# Build source maps. Vite emits these in `build.sourcemap: 'hidden'`
# mode for local debugging, but they don't get referenced from the
# shipped JS (no `//# sourceMappingURL=` comment) — and they're ~900 KB
# each, so committing them inflates every push for no shipping benefit.
*.js.map

# Note: the JS / CSS / HTML bundle IS intentionally committed (no
# `dist/` ignore). We pre-build with `npm run build` and commit the
# output so Cloudflare Pages can deploy without needing a custom
# build step in the dashboard. When/if we migrate to CF-managed
# builds, switch to ignoring the build output here too.
